| Question | Command / Method | Answer |
|----------|-----------------|--------|
| Q1 — Find flag.txt in uploads | WPScan finds open dir → browse /wp-content/uploads/2021/08/ | 0ptions_ind3xeS_ftw! |
| Q2 — Hidden plugin name | curl /?p=1 \| grep plugins | WP Sitemap Page |
