> - 2FA enforced at `/2fa.php` after login (ownership-based TOTP) → combined = 2FA.
> - Password reset flow present (`/reset.php`, `/security_question.php`, `/reset_password.php`).
> - Session managed via `PHPSESSID` cookie.
